---
import { homeAssets } from "../../data/home";
---

<section id="entry" class="final-cta" aria-labelledby="entry-title">
  <div class="final-cta__image" aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="0.28" style={`--castle-image: url(${homeAssets.castleHero})`}></div>
  <div class="final-cta__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <span class="final-cta__ember final-cta__ember--one" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="final-cta__ember final-cta__ember--two" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="final-cta__content" data-reveal>
    <span class="final-cta__mark" aria-hidden="true">冥</span>
    <h2 id="entry-title">まだ名を持たない魂へ。</h2>
    <p>城門の先で何者になるかは、<br />入ってから決めればいい。</p>
    <div class="cta-group cta-group--center"><a class="cta cta--primary" href="/join">城門を叩く <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="cta cta--secondary" href="/join">現在の入城状況を確認する</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
